{
  "name": "House Build Shorts - Veo 3 to YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## House build Shorts (Veo 3)\nEvery 12h: takes the next **Pending** row from Google Sheets, writes an 8-scene script, generates 8 vertical Veo 3 clips (8s each, with native construction sound), stitches them into one **60s** 9:16 video with Creatomate (each clip trimmed to 7.5s), then posts to YouTube Shorts, Facebook, Instagram Reels and TikTok.\n\n**Before running:** fill in the **Config** node and pick your Sheet + Drive folder + credentials on each node.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 660
      },
      "id": "de2f1488-7b1f-48c3-b829-77882d6aef6a",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Topic + script\nGemini writes 8 consistent scene prompts (same house, same camera angle).",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1080,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1458265a-3c2d-4fe0-ba27-bd577515b634",
      "name": "Note: Script",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Generate 8 Veo 3 clips\nOne clip per loop pass. Each clip is saved to a public Drive folder so Creatomate can read it.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d982a639-86e7-4dd7-b32b-9beb6b9c7aaf",
