    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"title\": \"We built this house from an empty field in 60 seconds #Shorts\",\n  \"description\": \"From bare dirt to dream home. Which stage would you skip? Tell us in the comments!\",\n  \"hashtags\": \"#housebuilding #construction #timelapse #dreamhome #diy #shorts\",\n  \"house_design\": \"A two-storey modern farmhouse, white board-and-batten siding, black metal gable roof, large black-framed windows, wooden front porch, on a flat green plot with oak trees behind\",\n  \"scenes\": [\n    {\n      \"stage\": \"Clearing the plot\",\n      \"veo_prompt\": \"Vertical 9:16 fast construction timelapse, fixed locked-off wide shot from the south-east corner of a flat green plot with oak trees behind. Surveyors place stakes and string lines, a yellow excavator digs the foundation trench, dirt piles grow, sun and shadows sweep quickly across the ground. This is the site of a two-storey modern farmhouse with white board-and-batten siding and a black metal gable roof. Sound: excavator engine, beeping reverse alarms, shovels in soil. No music, no dialogue, no text.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"stage\": \"Pouring the foundation\",\n      \"veo_prompt\": \"Vertical 9:16 fast construction timelapse, same fixed wide shot from the south-east corner of the flat green plot with oak trees behind. Workers tie rebar in the trench, a concrete mixer truck pours grey concrete, workers smooth the slab, it cures and dries lighter in colour. Foundation for a two-storey modern farmhouse with white board-and-batten siding and a black metal gable roof. Sound: concrete mixer drum, pump hum, trowels scraping. No music, no dialogue, no text.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
      },
